+        <p>@Localizer["Supply a solid CAD model such as STEP and a readable dimensioned drawing for each part. Identify units, part number and revision consistently across both files. A model describes nominal shape; it does not reliably communicate every thread, fit, cosmetic requirement or inspection condition. If model and drawing disagree, identify which requirement governs before machining begins."]</p>
+        <p>@Localizer["Separate functional requirements from preferences. A sealing face may need controlled flatness and texture, while a hidden relief pocket may only need clearance. Mark features that can change after discussion and those fixed by an existing assembly. Include mating-part information or a simple assembly view when a dimension alone does not explain why a feature matters."]</p>
+        <ul class="docs-checklist">
