+        <p>@Localizer["Retaining material for support during roughing and approaching the final section in stages can help control deflection. Sandvik describes alternating sides and staged strategies according to wall proportions. These are process-planning approaches, not design acceptance limits. Ask whether a rib, shorter wall, thicker base or temporary support feature is compatible with the part function and final assembly."]</p>
+        <figure class="docs-figure">
